                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Proud to have Chairman @RepBost of the @HouseVetAffairs in my district this week!\n\nWe hosted a roundtable in Pasco where we heard from veterans about the VA, healthcare, and disability claims, and listened to the issues they have receiving the benefits they deserve. https://t.co/l1ZUXBFSKC",
