                "text": "It was great visiting the Columbia Basin Veterans Hub with counselor Robert Bates.\n\nHe shared some insights regarding the mental health of our veterans, as well as the importance of healthcare accessibility in our rural regions. https://t.co/QPaDmvYs88",
