                "text": "It looks like the Governor and I disagree; I support able-bodied adults without dependents working, volunteering, or pursuing education for 20 hours per week to receive taxpayer-funded benefits. He supports allowing Medicaid to become insolvent for future generations. I\u2019ll continue to work to protect the program for those who truly need it and are eligible. All you have to do is meet the requirements.",
